Madam,

All is made ready as you asked. The back stair will be unwatched after the ho=
usehold sleeps, and I will keep the door myself.

Master Culpeper will come when the King rides out to hunt. Send word by me on=
ly =E2=80=94 trust nothing to the ordinary post, and keep nothing in writing =
that you would not wish read aloud.

Your faithful servant,
Jane Rochford
